# CareFlow – Clinical Pathway Process Mining

## Power BI Dashboard

This dashboard presents an overview of hospital OPD appointment data.

### Dashboard Objectives
- Monitor unique appointments and unique patients.
- Analyze appointments across workflow categories.
- Explore doctor-wise appointment distribution.
- Support exploration of patient care workflows.

### Dashboard Components
- KPI Cards: Unique Appointments, Unique Patients, Workflow Categories, Doctor Count
- Bar Chart: Appointments by Workflow
- Donut Chart: Workflow Distribution
- Column Chart: Appointments by Doctor
- Slicers: Workflow, Doctor, Appointment Date

### Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Power Query
- Excel
- Python

### Notes
The dashboard is based on a sample hospital OPD dataset. The metrics and visuals should be interpreted according to the available data and its limitations.

### Future Improvements
- Validate appointment and patient metrics.
- Review timestamp quality.
- Improve workflow analysis and process visualization.
